# Vercel Deployment Optimization Ignore
# Prevents raw 3D assets, DCC project files, and backups from inflating deployment storage

# Raw 3D authoring formats
*.max
*.blend
*.c4d
*.ma
*.e3d
*.pdf

# Backups and temporary files
*backup*.html
temp_*
scratch_*
archive/

# Test models & raw texture dumps
character_texture_*
*extracted*
8d96bc9d*
122a9240*
*.log
